        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-HPULL24-622, 24 Inch Matte Black Ladder Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe perfect pull for almost any residential or commercial space, the Matte Black 24 Inch Ladder Pull is available in thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted for wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It has a 14 inch center to center with a 1-1/4 inch diameter. The durable powder coated Matte Black finish is rich and dark, adding to the contemporary feel. Since it is made out of stainless steel tubing, this 2 Foot Door Pull is made to last.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-HPULL24-Specifications.gif?v=1704354532\" width=\"493\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-HPULL24-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/matte-black-36-inch-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull36-622\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-matte-black-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull48-622\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/60-inch-black-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull60-622\"><b>60\" Black Door Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD HPULL24-622 Contemporary Matte Black Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 24\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14\" (355 mm) </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Matte Black 24 Inch Ladder Pull, DWD-HPULL24-622",
                "description": "DWD-HPULL24-622, Matte Black 24 Inch Ladder Pull - The perfect pull for almost any residential or commercial space, the Matte Black 24 Inch Ladder Pull is available in thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted for wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It has a 14 inch center to center with a 1-1/4 inch diameter. The Matte Black finish is rich and dark, adding to the contemporary feel. Since it is made out of stainless steel tubing, this 2 Foot Door Pull is made to last.",
